  "description": "FS.GG workspace scaffolder — composes a selectable Standard or Typed SDD lifecycle, a runnable provider workspace, and an optional Governance overlay in one command, with a rich Spectre.Console progress UI. Orchestrates existing published machinery; no FS.GG.Templates checkout required.",
  "id": "FS.GG.NewSddWorkspace",
