  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.23.2 installs and updates FS.GG packages from nuget.org only (FS-GG/.github#5339). The Wizard no longer prefers the org GitHub Packages feed when FSGG_PACKAGES_TOKEN, GH_TOKEN or GITHUB_TOKEN is set: the governance overlay install, the fsgg-sdd self-update and the project-knowledge overlay install read nuget.org anonymously from an isolated nuget.config, and no token is passed to any package source. The package itself is published to nuget.org only. The 0.23.1 behaviour is otherwise unchanged: Wizard-owned .fsgg/security-obligations.json and .fsgg/coordination-retrofits.json with tolerant migration of 0.23.0 members, the coordination kit pinned to FS-GG/.github commit a9a6f77f32bda1138af35981bd5fffee5f0f6594 by sha256 anchors with the embedded initialize-sdd-workspace skill kept authoritative, catalog creation with stable SDD CLI 2.5.3 or newer, the published FS.GG.Templates 0.20.1 selection and registry defaults. The independent release route reuses authenticated published coherent124 dependencies. Published Creator 0.23.1 and its journal remain immutable history. Publication and genuine installed adoption require their own acceptance.",
